„K|8‚#8â"B‚	ŽàŽxˆ ½Q¾NX ½Q¾N0äÁ‡#8‚#8ÂtWÈ6/ 	y␀SÑa@@ÅAW$àBR‚J ˜´#rÓ‘’`)€)ÃRPÉd˜hT˜ÐaÁ„º@wA%“q`¢Q`B‡\èè´õ~“°
*JFˆóáŽàT|>ÁaÂ€„Œh8@"2:¨8ÈÐ!Ã„º␀«@°Ä‡#8‚#."$˜°ðáŽàˆ‡A␀Ò‹åëD€U␀Ò‹åëD␀S`A|8‚#8ÂQ$È6/ ‰Á+SVª|‘g?"""""""""""‚Ü‹§¬ &íˆÜ£SÉ(Š´õ~“ÄÎˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ ÷â)+¨‚I;"÷èT2té^´òu‹ò”jìüˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆr/ž²‚J ˜´#rN%“1 C†&‰AîÅSVP	“vDîÑÉÐ!ÃBe"
L÷¢•¯XÆv~DDDDDDDDDDD¹OYA%LÚ¹‡€A(:•Œ␀ˆÈˆÓ½håëOQ0…AîÅSVP	“vDî!`ŠN%£BÄ£ªzÛI¹‡I4*Q@DX‚Ü‹§¬ &íˆÜCÀ Œ*Tˆx4˜È0¡Ã˜x„pààGDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDD @ƒK{ñ”TÁ¤‘{„¢SÉ¨ñhüˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆD8xˆ‚Ü‹§¬ &íˆÜCÀ Œ*Tˆx4˜È0¡ÃÂˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ@„,y[ŒAUo;	"÷ø¸0 cà"c@‡Œ2*™Œ#È½xÊ
*`ÒŽÈ=~DDDDDDDDDDD¦»ê@¶yAC…¸ÈÐ!CDC@'c@‡ŒJ&ã@␀DdDAîÅSVP	“vDî!`*Ð]{ñ”TÁ¤‘{„¢SÉdè¡B„
D@`ä^<e•@0iGäJ&c@‡"\XP "~DDDDDDDDD,:dˆh¨d2&,¸Ðº2tÈÑPÉdLXp¡£ÓÖû=L2À*¨d\t2:¨8ÈÐ!CDC€œGpGˆ° âGDDDDDDDDDðáŽà®€$, „&\HDW]<1‚fF}aäÈa)0ñ:„pàtáÀ	$ÑUUJahfÔö@Ž–/° CX@XâÃÁLXøpGpÄC„ ␀éÅˆòu"À*␀éÅˆòu"€)° >ÁÁ¹ê
äÁ‡#8‚#8¦␀$¢«.žA3£¾øpGpGÀ€DtÕE•RšõÅ‡#8‚#DXPñùpGp„Â€%␀éÅˆòu‚Gp„*rnBEGIN
	-- Declare the return variable here
	DECLARE @SQL AS NVARCHAR(MAX),
	@NewLine NVARCHAR(2) = CHAR(13) + CHAR(10)
	-- CRLF
	/*Main Select*/
	SET @SQL = 	'	CASE WHEN ' + @TABLENAME + '.ADDRKEY > 1 THEN
						(CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ADDRTYPE)) = ''A'' THEN
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STSUB)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STSUB)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STSUB)) + '' '' END
							 WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ADDRTYPE)) = ''I'' THEN
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE ''Intersection of '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE '' and '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2NAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2NAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2NAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2POSTDIR)) + '' '' END
 							 WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ADDRTYPE)) = ''B'' THEN
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.FULLSTNO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.FULLSTNO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE ''Block of '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.FULLSTNO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.FULLSTNO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.FULLSTNO)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE '', '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2NAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2NAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2NAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST2POSTDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE '', '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3NAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3NAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3NAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ST3POSTDIR)) + '' '' END
							 WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ADDRTYPE)) = ''R'' THEN
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE '' to '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNOHI)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNOHI)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNOHI)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.PREDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STNAME)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.SUFFIX)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.POSTDIR)) + '' '' END +
								CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STSUB)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STSUB)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STSUB)) + '' '' END
						END) + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.CITY)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.CITY)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.CITY)) + '' '' END + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STATE)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STATE)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.STATE)) + '' '' END + 	CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ZIP)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ZIP)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AddressInfo.ZIP)) + '' '' END'

	IF (@TABLENAME = 'BusinessLicense')
						SET @SQL = @SQL + @NewLine + 'WHEN ' + @TABLENAME + '.PARCEL > 1 THEN ParcelInfo.PRCLID
										 WHEN ' + @TABLENAME + '.PROPERTY > 1 THEN PropertyInfo.PROPID'
					 ELSE
						SET @SQL = @SQL + @NewLine + ' WHEN ' + @TABLENAME + '.PRCLKEY > 1 THEN ParcelInfo.PRCLID
										WHEN ' + @TABLENAME + '.PROPKEY > 1 THEN PropertyInfo.PROPID'


	SET @SQL = @SQL + @NewLine +' WHEN ' + @TABLENAME + '.COMPKEY > 1 THEN
							CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo.COMPDESC)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo.COMPDESC)) = ''''
								THEN ''''
								ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo.COMPDESC))
							END
							+
							'' - ''
							+
							CASE
								WHEN AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 21 OR AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 28 OR AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 31 OR AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 41  OR AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 81 THEN
									CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo1.COMPDESC)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo1.COMPDESC)) = ''''
										THEN ''''
										ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo1.COMPDESC)) + '' ''
									END
									+
									CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo1.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo1.UNITID)) = ''''
										THEN ''''
										ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo1.UNITID))
									END
									+
									'' to ''
									+
									CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo2.COMPDESC)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo2.COMPDESC)) = ''''
										THEN ''''
										ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetTypeInfo2.COMPDESC)) + '' ''
									END
									+
									CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo2.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo2.UNITID)) = ''''
										THEN ''''
										ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo2.UNITID))
									END
									+ '' # ''
									+
									CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) = ''''
										THEN ''''
										ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) + '' ''
									END'
	
	SET @SQL = @SQL + @NewLine + 'WHEN AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 81 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP1)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP1)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP1)) + '' '' END + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP2)) + '' '' END + '' to '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY2)) + '' '' END + '' # '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) + '' '' END
								WHEN AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 68 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) + '' '' END + '' - '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) + '' '' END
								WHEN AssetInfo.COMPTYPE = 89 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) + '' '' END + '' - '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) + '' '' END + '' # '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) + '' '' END
								ELSE
									CASE
										WHEN AssetTypeInfo.CLASS = 1 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) + '' '' END
										WHEN AssetTypeInfo.CLASS = 2 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP1)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP1)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP1)) + '' '' END + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY1)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY1)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY1)) + '' '' END + '' to '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINCOMP2)) + '' '' END + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.MAINKEY2)) + '' '' END + '' # '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) + '' '' END
										WHEN AssetTypeInfo.CLASS = 3 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) + '' '' END + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID2)) + '' '' END + '' # '' + CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.PARLINENO)) + '' '' END
										WHEN AssetTypeInfo.CLASS = 4 THEN CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) + '' '' END
										ELSE CASE WHEN LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) = '''' THEN '''' ELSE LTRIM(RTRIM(AssetInfo.UNITID)) END
									END
							END
						ELSE ''''
				END '

	RETURN @SQL

